---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotEnded AND whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard --> q_check_position: guards pass
    q_check_position --> q_create_pos: _getInvestorPositionId(msg.sender) == 0
    q_create_pos --> q_verify_sig: positionId = _createInvestorPosition(msg.sender)
    q_check_position --> q_verify_sig: positionId = s_investorPositionIds[msg.sender]
    q_verify_sig --> q_decode: _verifyInvestSignature(signature)
    q_decode --> q_verify_pubkey: (encryptedAmountOut, sealedBidPublicKey) = abi.decode(sealedBid)
    q_verify_pubkey --> q_revert_key: ECIES.isValid(sealedBidPublicKey) == false OR pubkey mismatch
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert LegionSale__InvalidBidPublicKey()
    q_verify_pubkey --> q_verify_amount: valid key matching sale pubkey
    q_verify_amount --> q_verify_refund: _verifyMinimumInvestAmount(amount)
    q_verify_refund --> q_verify_excess: _verifyHasNotRefunded(positionId)
    q_verify_excess --> q_update: _verifyHasNotClaimedExcess(positionId)
    q_update --> q_emit: totalCapitalInvested += amount; investedCapital += amount
    q_emit --> q_transfer: emit CapitalInvested(amount, encryptedAmountOut, msg.sender, positionId)
    q_transfer --> [*]: safeTransferFrom(bidToken, msg.sender, address(this), amount)

    note right of q_decode
        INV-001: sealed bid public key must match sale-level public key
        INV-002: ECIES public key must be a valid elliptic curve point
        INV-003: encrypted amount is opaque until private key is revealed
    end note
